## Project Structure Rules

### Root Layout
```
atlas-world-svc/
├── .claude/
│   ├── agents/           # Domain reviewer & studio role agents
│   ├── idea_backlog/     # Captured ideas (ps-release-workflow)
│   └── refined_backlog/  # Refined feature specs & plans
├── .cursor/
│   └── rules/            # Development rules
├── docs/                 # Specs (unit-contract.md, asset-delivery-spec.md, *.spec.md, superpowers/)
├── server-rs/
│   ├── src/
│   │   ├── main.rs       # Server entry point (ws://localhost:2567)
│   │   ├── ai/           # Mob AI behaviors and strategies
│   │   ├── combat/       # Melee, projectiles, parry, damage
│   │   ├── content/      # Bestiary, maps, items, skills, world regions
│   │   ├── core/         # SimClock (monotonic simulated time), speed scaling
│   │   ├── fleet/        # Agones fleet lifecycle
│   │   ├── meta/         # Meta persistence and RPCs
│   │   ├── net/          # WebSocket gateway and session handling
│   │   ├── physics/      # rapier2d physics
│   │   └── systems/      # ECS simulation systems (bevy_ecs)
│   ├── tests/            # Rust integration tests
│   ├── Cargo.toml
│   └── Dockerfile
├── game-client/          # Godot 4.7 C# NativeAOT client
│   ├── src/              # C# client gameplay, world, rendering, networking
│   └── assets/           # Baked res:// assets and manifests
├── contracts/            # Shared TypeScript contracts & schemas
├── client/
│   └── react-client/     # React web client
├── content/              # Story, maps, characters, studio JSON, generated/*.json
├── atelier/              # Art/asset/map build pipelines and review panels
├── scripts/              # Verification gates, content checks, observatory tools
└── README.md
```

### Rust Server (`server-rs/`) Organization
- **core/**: `SimClock` (monotonic simulated time), `speed.rs` (`docs/unit-contract.md` metre scaling)
- **ecs/** & **systems/**: `bevy_ecs` world state and deterministic tick systems
- **physics/**: `rapier2d` collision and spatial queries
- **combat/** & **ai/**: authoritative damage, projectiles, parry, mob steering/targeting
- **meta/** & **fleet/**: native meta persistence/RPCs and Agones lifecycle (replacing retired Nakama/Colyseus)
- **tests/**: Rust integration tests (`cargo test`)

### Godot Client (`game-client/`) Organization
- **src/**: C# scripts (`VerticalSliceRoot.cs`, `World/`, `Net/`, `UI/`)
- **assets/**: `manifest.json`, `catalog-manifest.json`, `audio-manifest.json`, `music-manifest.json`, `render-spec.json`

### Shared Contracts & Web Client
- **contracts/**: pnpm workspace package (`@atlas/contracts`) with Jest tests
- **client/react-client/**: React TypeScript client (own `package-lock.json`)

### Configuration Management
- **Environment variables** for secrets and runtime ports (`PORT=2567`)
- **Pinned versions** in `.release.json` (`nodeMajor` for map/byte determinism)
- **Unit contract**: `1 game unit = 1 metre` everywhere (`docs/unit-contract.md`)
